  their  100644 b3ca59213d6884020c2a8f9067521534669d87bb docs/audits/wx-phase1b5-9-context-intent/ARCHITECTURE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# WX Phase 1B.5.9 — Architecture
+
+**Contract:** `wx-context-intent-v1` · `1.0.0` · phase `1b.5.9`
+
+## Pipeline
+
+Registry → Presentation → Assist → Disclosure → Tool → Honesty → Priority → Relevance → **Intent**
+
+## Role
+
+Classifies WHICH user intent the already-authorized Workspace context represents. Diagnostics only.
+
+## Sealed non-effects
+
+No render · no layout · no ordering · no visibility · no activation · no ownership · no chrome · no feed · no change to Relevance / Priority / Honesty / Tool / Disclosure / Assist / Presentation.
